{"item_uid": "分科113-geography-001", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "分科", "year_roc": 113, "year_ce": 2024, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "108課綱", "number": 1, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分、單選題（占64分）", "stem": "圖1是臺灣某廟宇的對聯上聯，對聯文字顯示該廟宇所在縣市的地理特色。該縣市除此廟宇、北回歸線標等觀光資源外，\n還可能包括下列何者？（註：嶋=島）", "options": {"A": "峽谷", "B": "苔原", "C": "錐狀火山", "D": "珊瑚礁生態"}, "option_source": "inline", "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": "說明：第1題至第32題，每題2分。", "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "docx", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 22.0, "B": 6.0, "C": 26.0, "D": 47.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 22.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 25.0, "D": 51.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 21.0, "B": 9.0, "C": 26.0, "D": 44.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 47.0, "p_high": 51.0, "p_low": 44.0, "discrimination": 7.0, "p_quintiles": [54.0, 46.0, 46.0, 45.0, 43.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "分科113-geography-002", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "分科", "year_roc": 113, "year_ce": 2024, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "108課綱", "number": 2, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分、單選題（占64分）", "stem": "蔓生千斤拔是矮生灌木，根具有固氮作用，抓地力強，尼泊爾農技人員在喜馬拉雅山\n南坡的梯田邊緣，將其作為綠籬。該國農技人員將千斤拔納入農業系統中，最可能是\n認為該植物具有下列哪項環境保育效益？", "options": {"A": "預防病蟲侵害", "B": "降低侵蝕基準", "C": "緩解土壤沖蝕", "D": "減少蒸發散量"}, "option_source": "inline", "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": "說明：第1題至第32題，每題2分。", "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "docx", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 1.0, "B": 6.0, "C": 91.0, "D": 2.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 0.0, "B": 1.0, "C": 98.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 2.0, "B": 11.0, "C": 83.0, "D": 4.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 91.0, "p_high": 98.0, "p_low": 83.0, "discrimination": 15.0, "p_quintiles": [99.0, 96.0, 93.0, 89.0, 80.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "分科113-geography-003", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "分科", "year_roc": 113, "year_ce": 2024, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "108課綱", "number": 3, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分、單選題（占64分）", "stem": "2023年6月，臺東縣金峰鄉才有連鎖便利商店的設立，一般認為其將會衝擊到當地既有的雜貨店，不過當地雜貨店的老闆說：「他有信心可以留住客戶，因為雜貨店的人情味\n濃厚，客戶常來店裡聊天。」就老闆的說法，雜貨店的存在最符合下列哪個概念\n陳述的重點？", "options": {"A": "城鄉關係", "B": "生產客製化", "C": "節點與連線", "D": "空間的社會性"}, "option_source": "inline", "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": "說明：第1題至第32題，每題2分。", "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "docx", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 10.0, "B": 4.0, "C": 5.0, "D": 80.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 1.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 1.0, "D": 97.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 23.0, "B": 8.0, "C": 12.0, "D": 57.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 80.0, "p_high": 97.0, "p_low": 57.0, "discrimination": 40.0, "p_quintiles": [98.0, 94.0, 87.0, 75.0, 47.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
