{"item_uid": "分科113-geography-005", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "分科", "year_roc": 113, "year_ce": 2024, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "108課綱", "number": 5, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分、單選題（占64分）", "stem": "過去美國將許多廢棄電子產品運往中國提煉貴金屬，近期中國經濟發展程度提高，促使電子垃圾大多轉往南方區域的西非國家處理。學者指出：因西非國家處理電子垃圾仍以焚燒方式為主，已對當地環境與勞工健康帶來更大的危害。該現象最能夠說明西非國家的經濟發展，最可能具有下列哪項特點？", "options": {"A": "已進入到後工業化的經濟發展階段", "B": "積極推動進口替代的經濟發展策略", "C": "受限於世界體系內的經濟發展差異", "D": "持續維持殖民地式的經濟發展特色"}, "option_source": "inline", "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": "說明：第1題至第32題，每題2分。", "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "docx", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 7.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 78.0, "D": 13.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 0.0, "B": 0.0, "C": 94.0, "D": 6.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 16.0, "B": 5.0, "C": 59.0, "D": 20.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 78.0, "p_high": 94.0, "p_low": 59.0, "discrimination": 35.0, "p_quintiles": [96.0, 90.0, 81.0, 72.0, 51.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "分科113-geography-006", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "分科", "year_roc": 113, "year_ce": 2024, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "108課綱", "number": 6, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分、單選題（占64分）", "stem": "新聞提到：「菲律賓首都馬尼拉南方約30多公里處的Santa Rosa市，市長細數其近年政績，包括工業區的設立、農業用地的保留、新興住宅區的建設，使該市已逐漸成為\n馬尼拉大都會的一部分。」上述內容最適合用來說明下列哪項概念？", "options": {"A": "都市成長", "B": "競租曲線", "C": "都市擴張", "D": "假性都市化"}, "option_source": "inline", "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": "說明：第1題至第32題，每題2分。", "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "docx", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 28.0, "B": 1.0, "C": 69.0, "D": 3.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 14.0, "B": 0.0, "C": 85.0, "D": 0.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 41.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 51.0, "D": 6.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 69.0, "p_high": 85.0, "p_low": 51.0, "discrimination": 34.0, "p_quintiles": [88.0, 79.0, 70.0, 59.0, 47.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "分科113-geography-007", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "分科", "year_roc": 113, "year_ce": 2024, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "108課綱", "number": 7, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分、單選題（占64分）", "stem": "2023年西亞政治局勢緊張，葉門武裝組織攻擊紅海航線的貿易商船，為了安全考量，許多貨輪被迫放棄通行蘇伊士運河。此衝擊對全球海運最可能帶來下列哪項直接影響？", "options": {"A": "黑海貨運取代紅海航線", "B": "歐亞貨運運輸成本增加", "C": "降低歐美之間貨物需求", "D": "波斯灣石油運輸量大減"}, "option_source": "inline", "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": "說明：第1題至第32題，每題2分。", "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "docx", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 4.0, "B": 88.0, "C": 1.0, "D": 7.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 1.0, "B": 96.0, "C": 0.0, "D": 3.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 7.0, "B": 77.0, "C": 3.0, "D": 12.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 88.0, "p_high": 96.0, "p_low": 77.0, "discrimination": 19.0, "p_quintiles": [98.0, 94.0, 90.0, 86.0, 71.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "分科113-geography-008", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "分科", "year_roc": 113, "year_ce": 2024, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "108課綱", "number": 8, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分、單選題（占64分）", "stem": "2007年，印度實行一項名為「二次蜜月」的生育計畫，只要新婚夫妻在婚後兩年才生\n第一胎，就給予五千盧比的獎勵，若婚後三年才生第一胎，則給予七千五百盧比。希望藉由該生育計畫減少生育率持續上升，抑制人口總數加速膨脹的問題。生育計畫實施\n當時，印度最可能處於下列哪個人口轉型階段？", "options": {"A": "低穩定階段", "B": "高穩定階段", "C": "早期擴張階段", "D": "晚期擴張階段"}, "option_source": "inline", "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": "說明：第1題至第32題，每題2分。", "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "docx", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 14.0, "B": 13.0, "C": 51.0, "D": 22.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 5.0, "B": 8.0, "C": 71.0, "D": 16.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 22.0, "B": 18.0, "C": 34.0, "D": 26.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 51.0, "p_high": 71.0, "p_low": 34.0, "discrimination": 37.0, "p_quintiles": [78.0, 59.0, 49.0, 41.0, 30.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "分科113-geography-009", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "分科", "year_roc": 113, "year_ce": 2024, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "108課綱", "number": 9, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分、單選題（占64分）", "stem": "兩位學者針對近年來非洲各國的一項政策進行辯論。學者甲：「非洲各國實施這項政策，大幅增加了糧食作物生產，對解決非洲糧食問題帶來巨大貢獻。」學者乙：「非洲各國實施這項政策，雖增加糧食作物生產，但窮苦人家仍缺乏資金採買作物種子。其實\n並沒有解決非洲的糧食問題。」根據上述內容，兩位學者辯論的非洲各國政策最可能是下列何者？", "options": {"A": "產業轉型", "B": "綠色革命", "C": "生質能作物種植", "D": "農產貿易自由化"}, "option_source": "inline", "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": "說明：第1題至第32題，每題2分。", "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "docx", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 11.0, "B": 43.0, "C": 29.0, "D": 16.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 6.0, "B": 75.0, "C": 10.0, "D": 9.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 15.0, "B": 16.0, "C": 48.0, "D": 20.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 43.0, "p_high": 75.0, "p_low": 16.0, "discrimination": 59.0, "p_quintiles": [85.0, 57.0, 36.0, 23.0, 13.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "分科113-geography-010", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "分科", "year_roc": 113, "year_ce": 2024, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "108課綱", "number": 10, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分、單選題（占64分）", "stem": "圖2是1960-2015年美國、德國、中國、澳大利亞等國的碳排放量變化圖。圖3是\n該四國平均每人碳排放量圖。圖中何者是德國？", "options": {"A": "甲", "B": "乙", "C": "丙", "D": "丁"}, "option_source": "inline", "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": "說明：第1題至第32題，每題2分。", "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "docx", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 5.0, "B": 18.0, "C": 64.0, "D": 13.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 1.0, "B": 6.0, "C": 84.0, "D": 9.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 12.0, "B": 31.0, "C": 42.0, "D": 15.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 64.0, "p_high": 84.0, "p_low": 42.0, "discrimination": 42.0, "p_quintiles": [90.0, 76.0, 64.0, 54.0, 36.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "分科113-geography-011", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "分科", "year_roc": 113, "year_ce": 2024, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "108課綱", "number": 11, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分、單選題（占64分）", "stem": "2021年6月高雄外海的輸油管破裂，導致小琉球海域的海龜棲地受到影響，因此政府立即進行持續一週全面性的海龜數量調查。其最適合的調查方法為下列何者？", "options": {"A": "藉由水溫差異評估", "B": "透過問卷調查分析", "C": "利用電子地圖比對", "D": "以空拍機進行估算"}, "option_source": "inline", "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": "說明：第1題至第32題，每題2分。", "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "docx", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 29.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 23.0, "D": 47.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 22.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 13.0, "D": 63.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 37.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 30.0, "D": 31.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 47.0, "p_high": 63.0, "p_low": 31.0, "discrimination": 32.0, "p_quintiles": [67.0, 56.0, 46.0, 38.0, 26.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "分科113-geography-012", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "分科", "year_roc": 113, "year_ce": 2024, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "108課綱", "number": 12, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分、單選題（占64分）", "stem": "2022年宜蘭縣西帽山雨量站的累積雨量突破一萬毫米，來到12,022毫米。其中九月份的雨量為1,273毫米，而十月份的雨量高達4,574毫米，超過了臺灣本島許多地區的\n年降水量。上述十月份雨量的現象，最能夠反映下列何種降水概念？", "options": {"A": "年降水量", "B": "降水強度", "C": "降水季節", "D": "降水變率"}, "option_source": "inline", "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": "說明：第1題至第32題，每題2分。", "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "docx", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 3.0, "B": 38.0, "C": 21.0, "D": 38.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 1.0, "B": 54.0, "C": 18.0, "D": 27.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 6.0, "B": 25.0, "C": 25.0, "D": 44.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 38.0, "p_high": 54.0, "p_low": 25.0, "discrimination": 29.0, "p_quintiles": [60.0, 44.0, 36.0, 30.0, 22.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "分科113-geography-013", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "分科", "year_roc": 113, "year_ce": 2024, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "108課綱", "number": 13, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分、單選題（占64分）", "stem": "根據研究，氣溫降低時，空氣分子運動速度會變慢，且分子間的距離會拉近，導致空氣密度變大。因此在室外舉辦的棒球比賽，被球棒擊出的球，會因為空氣阻力較大而飛得不遠；反之，氣溫上升時，球的飛行軌跡情況則是相反。此外，在室內球場舉辦的比賽，因可控制球場溫度，較\n不會出現上述的情況。圖4為1960-2020年美國大聯盟棒球場比賽時平均氣溫的變化。據此研究，若只考慮氣溫因素，2010年以後大聯盟棒球比賽，最可能具有下列哪種現象？", "options": {"A": "室外球場每年平均的全壘打數量有增加趨勢", "B": "室外球場每年平均的全壘打數量有減少趨勢", "C": "室內球場每年平均的全壘打數量有增加趨勢", "D": "室內球場每年平均的全壘打數量有減少趨勢"}, "option_source": "inline", "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": "說明：第1題至第32題，每題2分。", "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "docx", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 84.0, "B": 7.0, "C": 8.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 94.0, "B": 3.0, "C": 3.0, "D": 0.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 70.0, "B": 13.0, "C": 16.0, "D": 2.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 84.0, "p_high": 94.0, "p_low": 70.0, "discrimination": 24.0, "p_quintiles": [96.0, 92.0, 88.0, 82.0, 61.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "分科113-geography-014", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "分科", "year_roc": 113, "year_ce": 2024, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "108課綱", "number": 14, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分、單選題（占64分）", "stem": "圖5為某種地形的衛星影像圖。該地形最可能為下列何者？", "options": {"A": "冰河消融後在端磧前形成的外洗扇", "B": "高山融雪匯成河川後形成的沖積扇", "C": "颱風誘發岩層崩壞形成的土石流扇", "D": "河口受海水阻擋後形成的三角洲扇"}, "option_source": "inline", "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": "說明：第1題至第32題，每題2分。", "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "docx", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 21.0, "B": 59.0, "C": 6.0, "D": 14.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 22.0, "B": 74.0, "C": 1.0, "D": 3.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 18.0, "B": 42.0, "C": 13.0, "D": 26.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 59.0, "p_high": 74.0, "p_low": 42.0, "discrimination": 32.0, "p_quintiles": [78.0, 68.0, 58.0, 51.0, 38.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "分科113-geography-015", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "分科", "year_roc": 113, "year_ce": 2024, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "108課綱", "number": 15, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分、單選題（占64分）", "stem": "近年來，歐盟有意推動地中海聯盟組織，以促進地中海南、北沿岸國家的經濟合作，\n但此合作模式並未得到歐盟成員國的善意回應，主因之一是地中海周邊國家彼此多有矛盾，政治摩擦不少，各國難以授權給地中海聯盟機制處理共同事務。下列何者屬於\n上述的矛盾？", "options": {"A": "摩洛哥與西班牙的漁業權爭執", "B": "埃及與蘇丹的水資源分配衝突", "C": "義大利與土耳其的領海劃分糾紛", "D": "象牙海岸與法國的殖民歷史仇恨"}, "option_source": "inline", "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": "說明：第1題至第32題，每題2分。", "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "docx", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 29.0, "B": 17.0, "C": 44.0, "D": 10.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 49.0, "B": 8.0, "C": 38.0, "D": 6.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 15.0, "B": 25.0, "C": 47.0, "D": 12.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 29.0, "p_high": 49.0, "p_low": 15.0, "discrimination": 34.0, "p_quintiles": [57.0, 33.0, 22.0, 18.0, 15.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "分科113-geography-016", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "分科", "year_roc": 113, "year_ce": 2024, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "108課綱", "number": 16, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分、單選題（占64分）", "stem": "亞馬孫南部地區林地野火事件層出不窮，有可能是開墾林地或是自然野火所造成。巴西政府於是發展出一套GIS應用軟體，讓不同部落分享野火知識及回報野火發生地點，並整合濕度與衛星影像資料，分析最可能發生火災的地區。此分析方法最可能是下列\n何者？", "options": {"A": "視域分析", "B": "疊圖分析", "C": "環域分析", "D": "地形（勢）分析"}, "option_source": "inline", "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": "說明：第1題至第32題，每題2分。", "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "docx", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 6.0, "B": 65.0, "C": 25.0, "D": 5.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 1.0, "B": 92.0, "C": 6.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 12.0, "B": 33.0, "C": 45.0, "D": 10.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 65.0, "p_high": 92.0, "p_low": 33.0, "discrimination": 59.0, "p_quintiles": [96.0, 84.0, 69.0, 49.0, 25.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "分科113-geography-017", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "分科", "year_roc": 113, "year_ce": 2024, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "108課綱", "number": 17, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分、單選題（占64分）", "stem": "圖6為冬季時北美洲某個位於兩條河流匯集處（40.4°N, 80.0°W）的都市景觀。\n照片左側河流發源於（41.9°N, 77.9°W），\n河面上有著浮冰分布，右側河流的源頭則位於（38.5°N, 80.8°W）。該照片拍攝角度，最可能是下列何者？", "options": {"A": "從方位角0°往90°拍攝", "B": "從方位角0°往180°拍攝", "C": "從方位角90°往180°拍攝", "D": "從方位角270°往90°拍攝"}, "option_source": "inline", "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": "說明：第1題至第32題，每題2分。", "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "docx", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 19.0, "B": 20.0, "C": 22.0, "D": 39.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 20.0, "B": 14.0, "C": 14.0, "D": 52.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 18.0, "B": 27.0, "C": 29.0, "D": 25.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 39.0, "p_high": 52.0, "p_low": 25.0, "discrimination": 27.0, "p_quintiles": [52.0, 48.0, 41.0, 30.0, 22.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "分科113-geography-018", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "分科", "year_roc": 113, "year_ce": 2024, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "108課綱", "number": 18, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分、單選題（占64分）", "stem": "光華商場是販售3C電子產品與零組件的著名商場，消費者可在商場內一次選購所需要的電子產品或零組件，也可比較不同店家販售相同產品的價格。上述商場的經營型態，最可能是採用下列哪項策略？", "options": {"A": "產業群聚", "B": "水平整合", "C": "聚集經濟", "D": "產品標準化"}, "option_source": "inline", "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": "說明：第1題至第32題，每題2分。", "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "docx", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 40.0, "B": 15.0, "C": 39.0, "D": 6.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 26.0, "B": 11.0, "C": 60.0, "D": 2.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 52.0, "B": 17.0, "C": 21.0, "D": 10.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 39.0, "p_high": 60.0, "p_low": 21.0, "discrimination": 39.0, "p_quintiles": [66.0, 48.0, 35.0, 26.0, 19.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "分科113-geography-019", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "分科", "year_roc": 113, "year_ce": 2024, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "108課綱", "number": 19, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分、單選題（占64分）", "stem": "某旅行社在推銷不同國家的旅遊行程時，會根據出遊時各國的氣候狀況，建議旅客攜帶\n必要物品，下列何者是12月旅行不同國家時，最適合準備的物品？", "options": {"A": "甲乙丙", "B": "甲乙丁", "C": "乙丙戊", "D": "丙丁戊"}, "option_source": "inline", "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": "說明：第1題至第32題，每題2分。", "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "docx", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 80.0, "B": 8.0, "C": 10.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 97.0, "B": 1.0, "C": 2.0, "D": 0.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 58.0, "B": 20.0, "C": 20.0, "D": 3.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 80.0, "p_high": 97.0, "p_low": 58.0, "discrimination": 39.0, "p_quintiles": [98.0, 94.0, 87.0, 74.0, 49.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "分科113-geography-020", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "分科", "year_roc": 113, "year_ce": 2024, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "108課綱", "number": 20, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分、單選題（占64分）", "stem": "2024年12月底以後在歐盟銷售的手機，依該組織規定需全面採用USB Type-C充電\n插槽。該組織制定上述規定，最可能是在下列哪項背景下形成？", "options": {"A": "該組織議會通過與環境經濟相關法案，以降低電子垃圾產生", "B": "該組織中央銀行放寬歐元貨幣政策，以促進商品價格的統一", "C": "該組織法院針對申根區規範擴充法條，以避免設備不斷更換", "D": "該組織各國家分別制定法案，再統一由組織執行委員會執行"}, "option_source": "inline", "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": "說明：第1題至第32題，每題2分。", "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "docx", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 57.0, "B": 6.0, "C": 30.0, "D": 6.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 71.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 24.0, "D": 3.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 45.0, "B": 11.0, "C": 35.0, "D": 10.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 57.0, "p_high": 71.0, "p_low": 45.0, "discrimination": 26.0, "p_quintiles": [76.0, 64.0, 56.0, 51.0, 41.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "分科113-geography-021", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "分科", "year_roc": 113, "year_ce": 2024, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "108課綱", "number": 21, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分、單選題（占64分）", "stem": "臺中市新社區生產文心蘭的地區，具有日夜溫差大的優勢，使得花卉品質優良，深受\n日本市場喜愛；部分農友利用鴨子的雜食性，進行園區蝸牛等蟲害防治。若僅依據上文，該地文心蘭產業最可能具有下列哪項經營特徵？", "options": {"A": "透過傳統生態知識建立農作物最佳栽種環境", "B": "結合周遭多樣觀光資源帶動農業多角化經營", "C": "藉由生物防治、減少碳足跡以實踐綠色經濟", "D": "利用生物科技改良出日本市場所需花卉品種"}, "option_source": "inline", "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": "說明：第1題至第32題，每題2分。", "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "docx", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 56.0, "B": 3.0, "C": 39.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 65.0, "B": 1.0, "C": 34.0, "D": 0.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 47.0, "B": 8.0, "C": 42.0, "D": 3.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 56.0, "p_high": 65.0, "p_low": 47.0, "discrimination": 18.0, "p_quintiles": [67.0, 60.0, 57.0, 54.0, 43.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
